This product is the central evaluation platform for the ROCm document-parsing
zone (ROCmDoc Standard 1.0). It includes:

  - Original adapter/evaluation/hub code (Apache-2.0).
  - A reference to the upstream OmniDocBench benchmark
    (https://github.com/opendatalab/OmniDocBench), which has its own license;
    benchmark datasets and scorer are governed by their upstream licenses and
    are NOT redistributed here. Results reference upstream by immutable
    commit + dataset revision (ROCmDoc Standard §7.2).

Model weights, adapter code, and per-model evidence live in the separate
AIwork4me/<Model>-ROCm repositories, each under its own LICENSE/NOTICE with the
code/model/weights license split required by ROCmDoc Standard §10 QS-1. This
central NOTICE covers only the central platform code.
